14
00:00:55,214 --> 00:01:01,860
The first big news coming from OpenAI this past week has been their new feature for Chat GPT.

15
00:01:02,094 --> 00:01:04,240
It's called Intelligent UI.

16
00:01:04,718 --> 00:01:18,884
So instead of only replying with text, it's now able to shape its answer around your prompt, your prompt using visuals or using interactive elements that are directly embedded into the chat.

17
00:01:19,310 --> 00:01:31,920
So if you check out the launch announcement, especially for this one, I think you would understand this idea of the intelligent UI better if you go and see how they're showing it in the announcement they made.

18
00:01:32,238 --> 00:01:34,240
So they give a few real life examples.

19
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:45,380
Like, for example, they show these visual responses to very common questions, things like where you can check out like how to build a meal or how to plan a road trip.

20
00:01:45,614 --> 00:01:48,516
And it does it in this very interactive and visual way.

21
00:01:48,720 --> 00:01:52,960
As well, it does complex topics explained more easily.

22
00:01:53,166 --> 00:01:59,172
